body='<h1>Margin · Harness overhaul</h1><p class="muted">Updated '+E(now)+'</p><div class="banner"><b>Implemented and verified in the development build</b><p>The model now plans across tool results. The harness owns permission, approval, execution and recovery.</p></div><h2>What changed</h2><div class="grid"><section><h3>One agent loop</h3><p>Files, images, documents, calendar and research share planning and tool-result feedback. Errors return to the model for correction.</p></section><section><h3>Approval survives interruption</h3><p>Goals and pending calls persist. Changed state requires renewed approval. Interrupted writes are held as uncertain, with explicit reconciliation.</p></section><section><h3>Images stay on the page</h3><p>Vision evidence feeds the planner. Editable TXT is the default; Word and Markdown reuse the draft. Exports require an exact confirmed proposal.</p></section><section><h3>Bounded execution</h3><p>Step, time and context limits; cancellation; duplicate-write protection; grant revalidation; actual receipts before continuation.</p></section></div><h2>Verification by category</h2><table><tr><th>Category</th><th>Result</th><th>What this proves</th></tr>'
for cat,result,meaning in [('Loop and recovery','21/21','Production orchestration/journal replay, including crashes, storage failure and archived goals'),('Compiled app integration','17/17','Actual agent and confirmation handler; temporary files; scripted model/reader'),('Live Pilot 1','1 trajectory passed','Two checkpoints: correct preview and confirmed output plus continuation; 22.4s'),('Request/image guards','20/20','Argument fidelity and image-boundary rules'),('Filesystem export','12/12','No overwrite, grant revocation, ambiguous roots and Undo'),('Document export','10/10','TXT/MD byte fidelity, DOCX and reader normalization'),('Calendar / behavior / roadmap','15/15 · 16/16 · 45/45','Synthetic provider and existing behavior regressions; not live-provider effects'),('Build and native rendering','Passed','Debug compilation and inspected SwiftUI image-draft render')]:body+='<tr>'+''.join('<td>'+E(x)+'</td>' for x in [cat,result,meaning])+'</tr>'
body+='</table><h2>Native draft appearance</h2><p>This is a native component capture using a fixture image and scripted transcription. It is not evidence of model OCR accuracy or physical drag/drop.</p><img class="native" src="native-draft.png" alt="Native notebook image and editable document draft"><h2>Still to qualify before release</h2><p>Broad multi-step model reliability, live calendar/provider effects and complete native physical-input flows. No installed app replacement or master release was made. The existing app instances do not automatically acquire this build.</p><h2>Ornith comparison</h2><p>Keep Pilot 1 for now. Ornith passed 106/117 versus Pilot 1’s 110/117, and its median latency was 9.2s versus 4.0s. That frozen test used the earlier architecture and did not test Ornith image recognition. <a href="../ornith-uncensored-20260916/assessment.html">Read the final assessment</a>.</p><h2>Timestamped evidence</h2>'
